  "failureAttribution": {
    "red-01": "Real old functionality gaps: accessible tab list and explicit select bridge absent (2 failed).",
    "targeted-01": "39 Page failures and 55 errors from hook harness treating its first ref as the DOM surface; newly inserted first metadata ref received a mock DOM object. Stable surface-first ref ordering restored without changing product semantics. 62 passed.",
    "targeted-02": "158 passed, 2 failed: App retention case used an unseeded task/wrong Agent fixture; Page hide-ACK case caught extra microtask hop introduced by stale-show catch before visibility queue. Corrected scope error chaining to retain original queue scheduling while only selection-changed errors can recover. Raw failures retained.",
    "hidden-select-red": "Real new controller defect: explicit select pending then task hide changed intent and left changing=true forever. One selected test failed. Corrected completion to clear busy and retain acknowledged explicit choice while still hidden; no permission restored.",
    "targeted-03": "161 passed after fixes.",
    "targeted-04": "230 passed; before final listener/ownership cleanup and final shown-but-unselected notice."
  },
