  "verifiedBoundaries": [
    "Three and five real-owner objects retained without navigating/closing siblings; controlled protocol objects, not real native pages.",
    "Reservation tabs event before held open reply does not duplicate ownership; rejected open orphan recovered by exact backend label.",
    "Tab selection waits native-select acknowledgement; failed transitions keep owner, block presentation, and require explicit retry.",
    "Ordinary hide/task navigation preserves selection; manual snapshots reject selection ABA.",
    "Real scope native show failure still retires and retains close ownership; obsolete presentation intent does not close a retained tab.",
    "Pending ownership notifies parent synchronously; all page-owning tasks stay mounted; completed close removes only its tab.",
    "Late open remains owned by PageScope through a failed close and explicit retry.",
    "Listener failure and StrictMode-style late registration have bounded explicit recovery."
  ],
  "remaining": [
    "Root full App Chromium/WebKit and formal native validation pending.",
